    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's more than just a quiet space. It feels like... completion. Like a story that has reached its perfect, final sentence. I look at the future and I don't see more music, I just see the slow, messy decline of someone who used to be capable. I've reached the summit. Why should I wait around for the long, slow slide down the other side?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
